description: Asset imports via @assets alias in MidazAtlasApp
globs: MidazAtlasApp/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Assets (`@assets`)

- Import SVG/PNG from `assets/` using **`@assets/images/...`**, never deep relative paths.
- Examples:
  - `import IconX from '@assets/images/ordering/menu/icon-search.svg';`
  - `require('@assets/images/ordering/menu/product-cup-small.png')`
- Aliases: `@assets` → `./assets` (babel + TypeScript `paths`).
